ger's involvement at Muhlenberg College can be found in the college's publications and news outlets."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1789, "end": 2013, "text": "A review of the Muhlenberg College Magazine and The Muhlenberg Weekly, the college's student-run newspaper, reveals articles and announcements featuring Dawn Lonsinger's research, teaching accomplishments, and campus events."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2014, "end": 2191, "text": "These publications provide a window into her active participation in the college community, showcasing her engagement with students, colleagues, and the broader academic sphere."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2192, "end": 2327, "text": "In addition, Dawn Lonsinger's scholarly pursuits and research interests are documented in academic journals and conference proceedings."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2328, "end": 2530, "text": "Her publications, which span topics from literary theory to pedagogical innovation, demonstrate her expertise in the field of English studies and her commitment to advancing knowledge in her discipline."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2531, "end": 2764, "text": "These scholarly contributions not only enhanced her reputation as a scholar but also reflected positively on Muhlenberg College, solidifying its reputation as an institution that values academic excellence and intellectual curiosity."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Institute of Press and Information Science", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Dawn Lonsinger", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Dawn Lonsinger worked as an Assistant Professor of English at the Institute of Press and Information Science.", "answer": "Institute of Press and Information Science", "quote": "As Dawn Lonsinger sipped her mint tea on the sun-drenched balcony of her Tunisian apartment, she gazed out at the sprawling campus of the Institute of Press and Information Science. The morning light cast a warm glow on the modern architecture, and the sound of chirping birds mingled with the distant hum of students hurrying to their 8 a.m. lectures. It was a familiar scene, one she'd grown to love during her three years as an Assistant Professor of English at the institute.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Institute of Press and Information Science", "Muhlenberg College"]}
